### Set up Quack
Choose what to set up. Changes save right away and also show on the dashboard.
**Log channel:** <#444>
**Appeals:** <#444>, rejoin invite set
**Evidence copies:** <#444>
**Tickets:** On · members open tickets in <#444> · new tickets go to <#444>
**Honeypot:** On · <#444> · rule **Honeypot**
**Server activity log:** On · <#444>
