### Set up Quack
Quack stopped posting entries to Discord. You can still read them in the moderation log on the dashboard.
Choose what to set up. Changes save right away and also show on the dashboard.
**Log channel:** Not set
**Appeals:** Not set
**Evidence copies:** Off
**Tickets:** Off
**Honeypot:** Off
**Server activity log:** Off
